WEBVTT

00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:17,700
I was discussing the value of hyperbaric oxygen to a hyperbaric oxygen tank with a de-o-friend

00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:24,020
of mine and a question came up, does hyperbaric oxygen increase the metabolic activity of hyper-metabolic

00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:31,540
malignant cells? I haven't seen any evidence of that. So this is the difference between

00:00:32,260 --> 00:00:44,580
increased O2 and increased O negative. So understand chemistry a little bit. Hyperbaric oxygen

00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:56,420
increases oxygenation of tissue, increases O2 which can really help with cells. I don't think

00:00:56,580 --> 00:01:02,340
it increases metabolic activity of malignant cells. Matter fact, there's enough studies that show

00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:12,500
that it helps with cancer. The only thing I have negative against hyperbaric oxygen is that

00:01:13,140 --> 00:01:18,980
it's you almost have to have a hyperbaric oxygen tank in your house because you have to

00:01:19,060 --> 00:01:25,700
all the studies that have done hyperbaric oxygen have done it on a daily basis. And it tends

00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:33,380
to be better for brain issues. Hyperbaric oxygen really shines with brain cancer and brain issues

00:01:33,380 --> 00:01:39,940
and dementia issues. That's where hyperbaric oxygen really shines. For colon cancer, for liver

00:01:39,940 --> 00:01:46,980
cancer, it's pretty iffy. And it takes time, you know, you're doing it for at least an hour

00:01:46,980 --> 00:01:54,180
every day. So, you know, it's not one of my favorite therapies for that thing. But if a person

00:01:54,180 --> 00:01:59,780
has brain cancer, hyperbaric oxygen would be something that would be viable to add.

